        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This very night, in the world of VTubers where rivalries abound, a live stream program featuring Hololive talents shall begin once again.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It is the talents' ability to capture the perfect footage, the most streamable content, the most viral-worthy meme... It is the ability to draw the attention of a diverse fanbase and bring them enjoyment.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>People call such ability the HOLODAMA (opinions may vary).</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HOLODAMA refers to the ability to find and capture high-quality content during a stream while confronted with a variety of risky situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of <strong><i>mini &quot;&quot;chicken&quot;&quot; games</i></strong>, so to speak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains multiple mini-games starring Hololive talents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer for up to four players is also available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your chance to challenge your friends and family in a heated battle of content creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆Mini-Games Featuring Hololive Talents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080610/extras/27936bf563b61d693d2864a61be4e496.poster.avif?t=1766588123\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080610/extras/27936bf563b61d693d2864a61be4e496.webm?t=1766588123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080610/extras/27936bf563b61d693d2864a61be4e496.mp4?t=1766588123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;&quot;Stop a carriage as close to the cliff as possible and reach the castle&quot;&quot;</i> (Player: ☄️<strong>Hoshimachi Suisei</strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080610/extras/b72252d04d34500a0335dac2c67cb4f4.poster.avif?t=1766588123\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080610/extras/b72252d04d34500a0335dac2c67cb4f4.webm?t=1766588123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080610/extras/b72252d04d34500a0335dac2c67cb4f4.mp4?t=1766588123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;&quot;Load as much treasure as possible into a pirate ship without dropping anything into the sea&quot;&quot;</i> (Player: 🏴‍☠️<strong>Houshou Marine</strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080610/extras/c67441b833b81be8bf1e4286a3121b3c.poster.avif?t=1766588123\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080610/extras/c67441b833b81be8bf1e4286a3121b3c.webm?t=1766588123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080610/extras/c67441b833b81be8bf1e4286a3121b3c.mp4?t=1766588123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;&quot;Prank someone well enough to get them moderately freaked out, then reveal the prank&quot;&quot;</i> (Players: 🌽<strong>Shirakami Fubuki &amp; </strong>😈<strong>Nakiri Ayame</strong>)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All those mini-games and more (16 in all) for you to capture the perfect stream with!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session is a random selection of 5 mini-games. Aim for the highest score!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆Enjoy thrilling live stream battles in multiplayer mode!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080610/extras/8ff16a516e61417aa62a123d821f048f.poster.avif?t=1766588123\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080610/extras/8ff16a516e61417aa62a123d821f048f.webm?t=1766588123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080610/extras/8ff16a516e61417aa62a123d821f048f.mp4?t=1766588123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In multiplayer mode, two to four players can battle it out with each other amidst laughter and tears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know what can go wrong in a live stream...but fortune (and high scores) favors the brave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's see who's the better live streamer among family, friends, or fellow Hololive fans!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆Conquer the World in Crazy Endurance Mode!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once all mini-games have been unlocked, you gain access to Crazy Endurance mode, which pits you against the rest of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep aiming to get that Crazy score in this mode that's tailor-made for endurance streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See where you stand among the best in the world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆Compatible With Steam's Remote Play Together Feature!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Remote Play Together feature to play local multiplayer games with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Remote Play Together feature,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >one player simply installs and runs the game to play it together with friends over the internet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">──────────────────────────</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a participant in the indie game brand &quot;&quot;holo Indie&quot;&quot; (※2), developed by CCMC Inc. (※1.).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has been approved for distribution and monetization under the guidelines and regulations of &quot;&quot;holo Indie&quot;&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that the monetization of derivative games using content owned by Cover Corporation outside of &quot;&quot;holo Indie&quot;&quot; is not permitted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※1. About CCMC Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CCMC Corp. is entrusted with website management (ex: steam) including, examination, publishing and other necessary tasks by Cover Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※2. About &quot;&quot;holo Indie&quot;&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >holo Indie's objective is to cooperate with hololive production fans and creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a game brand that offers &quot;&quot;Game Creator Support Program&quot;&quot; for the derivative work games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more details about &quot;&quot;holo Indie&quot;&quot;, Please refer to the Cover Corp.'s &quot;&quot;Derivative work guidelines&quot;&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
